; Vantage 33M ATC test config — tool table
; T1:        dummy/plug tool (short, no flutes) — parked in the spindle
;            whenever a fixed drill is engaged, to keep dust out of the
;            spindle and clear of the workpiece. Not a cutting tool; M106
;            refuses to probe drill tool numbers for exactly this reason.
; T2-T20:    HSK63F ATC rack pockets (P = pocket number)
; T101-T107: vertical drills, fixed-mounted (P0, not stored in the rack)
; T201-T204: horizontal drills X+/X-/Y+/Y-, fixed-mounted (P0)
; D (diameter) and Z (length offset) are all placeholders — Z gets
; overwritten by M106 probing once run for that tool; D needs measuring
; per actual bit mounted in each pocket.
T1   P1  D0.0 Z0.0 ; dummy/plug tool - parked during drill operations
T2   P2  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 2 - HSK63F
T3   P3  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 3 - HSK63F
T4   P4  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 4 - HSK63F
T5   P5  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 5 - HSK63F
T6   P6  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 6 - HSK63F
T7   P7  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 7 - HSK63F
T8   P8  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 8 - HSK63F
T9   P9  D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 9 - HSK63F
T10  P10 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 10 - HSK63F
T11  P11 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 11 - HSK63F
T12  P12 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 12 - HSK63F
T13  P13 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 13 - HSK63F
T14  P14 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 14 - HSK63F
T15  P15 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 15 - HSK63F
T16  P16 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 16 - HSK63F
T17  P17 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 17 - HSK63F
T18  P18 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 18 - HSK63F
T19  P19 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 19 - HSK63F
T20  P20 D0.0 Z0.0 ; ATC pocket 20 - HSK63F
T101 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; vertical drill 1
T102 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; vertical drill 2
T103 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; vertical drill 3
T104 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; vertical drill 4
T105 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; vertical drill 5
T106 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; vertical drill 6
T107 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; vertical drill 7
T201 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; horizontal drill X+
T202 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; horizontal drill X-
T203 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; horizontal drill Y+
T204 P0  D0.0 Z0.0 ; horizontal drill Y-
